{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月24日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261124.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】神舟二十四號載人飛行任務即將於周三升空，中國太空站首次迎來外籍航天員，現時準備工作進入最後倒數階段，今次升空有甚麼看點？</p><p>周二的《時事全方位》，請來專家解讀。</p><p>題目：神廿四即將升空</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:14:58.927625+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:30:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:09:03.316284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:08:21.059007+00:00","content_hash":"25a1dd46f738661c23e0d8f1b996fa83e1d8d48362a4aacf0167b21be9c1ea71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}